{"ID":"20230925154404-ole4k6f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154404-ole4k6f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154404-ole4k6f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154407-ccgv6k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154407-v8c0y59\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154407-v8c0y59\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:33\u0026#125;","title":"【术附汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154407"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154407-ccgv6k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154407-ccgv6k1","updated":"20230925154407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：白术二两、甘草一两（炙）、附子一枚半（炮去皮）"}]},{"ID":"20230925154407-i38dup2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154407-i38dup2","updated":"20230925154407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上三味，剉，每五钱匕，姜五片，枣一枚。水盏半，煎七成，去滓，温服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154407-v8c0y59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154407-v8c0y59","updated":"20230925154407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《近效方》术附汤：治风虚头重眩，苦极，不知食味，暖饥补中，益精气。"}]}]}